<title>USA: U.S. Pawn knows of no reason for stock drop.</title>
<headline>U.S. Pawn knows of no reason for stock drop.</headline>
<dateline>WESTMINSTER, Colo. 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Pawn Inc said on Wednesday it was not aware of any changes in the company that would acount for its unusual stock activity.</p>
<p>U.S. Pawn shares dropped 29/32 to 3-3/32 in late trading.</p>
</text>
